  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;DAVE CARRICK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dave Carrick is a legendary figure in college basketball, known for his skills and dedication, and later discovered to have also been a skilled hockey player."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAFAYETTE COLLEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lafayette College is a prestigious institution where Dave Carrick played both basketball and hockey, and is recognized as a Division I institution."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCAA DIVISION I MEN'S BASKETBALL LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NCAA Division I men's basketball league is the highest level of collegiate basketball, where Dave Carrick played for Lafayette College."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEOPARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Leopards is the basketball team of Lafayette College, where Dave Carrick played during the 1971-1972 academic year."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL HOCKEY LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Hockey League is the highest level of professional hockey, which Dave Carrick considered pursuing instead of basketball."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UPSTATE NEW YORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Upstate New York is the region where Dave Carrick grew up, known for its cold climate and outdoor rinks."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1971&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1971 is the year when Dave Carrick played basketball and hockey at Lafayette College."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1972 NCAA MEN'S BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 1972 NCAA Men's Basketball Championship is an event where Lafayette College participated, with Dave Carrick's name on the roster."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASKETBALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Basketball is a sport that Dave Carrick excelled in during his time at Lafayette College."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HOCKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hockey is a sport that Dave Carrick also excelled in, particularly in his youth in upstate New York."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLLEGE HOOPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"College hoops refers to the college basketball scene, where Dave Carrick was a prominent figure."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAFAYETTE LEOPARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lafayette Leopards is the nickname for the basketball team of Lafayette College, where Dave Carrick played."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fate is the concept that influenced Dave Carrick's thoughts about his career choices and future opportunities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dave Carrick's parents bundled him up in layers of wool and down to brave the biting winds, supporting his love for hockey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUNDLED UP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bundled up refers to the act of dressing warmly, especially in cold weather, to protect oneself from the elements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BITING WINDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biting winds describe the harsh, cold winds that Dave Carrick experienced growing up in upstate New York."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0443</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;DAVE CARRICK&quot;" target="&quot;LAFAYETTE COLLEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dave Carrick played for Lafayette College in both basketball and hockey, making him a notable figure in the college's sports history."</data>
